<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday that Aames Financial Corp, American Express Co, Donna Karan International Inc, Steinway Musical Instruments Inc and Tandem Computer Inc were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA and the warrants of Olsten Corp also were unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
